Two fresh spring rolls (chicken or turkey with lettuce) come to about 280 kcal. The small brownie is about 120 kcal. The bowl of fruit salad, roughly 250 g, is about 100 kcal. That puts the total served at about 500 kcal.

I assumed a small amount would be left over, about 30 kcal, so the person eats about 470 kcal.

